---
/** Static about/intro block between the hero and the gallery. */
---

<section id="about" class="public-intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
	<div class="public-intro__inner">
		<figure class="public-intro__media">
			<img
				src="/brand/chris-lawson.webp"
				alt="Chris Lawson outdoors in a blue patterned shirt, adjusting his glasses"
				width="859"
				height="1024"
				loading="lazy"
				decoding="async"
				class="public-intro__img"
			/>
		</figure>
		<div class="public-intro__copy">
			<p class="public-intro__eyebrow">About</p>
			<h1 id="intro-title" class="public-intro__title">Hi, I’m Chris.</h1>
			<p class="public-intro__lede">
				I’m a software engineer in San Luis Obispo who spends a lot of his free time behind a
				camera.
			</p>
			<p class="public-intro__body">
				Most of what’s here was shot around the Central Coast: fog over Morro Bay, the hills above
				Big Sur, long evenings at the beach, along with portraits of friends and the people I get
				to spend time with.
			</p>
			<p class="public-intro__body">
				When I’m not taking photos, I’m building software at Amazon, mountain biking, scuba
				diving, or flying airplanes!
			</p>
			<a class="public-intro__link" href="https://chrislawson.dev" rel="me">
				More about me
				<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
